{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_1","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.cache\\\\codex-runtimes\\\\codex-primary-runtime\\\\dependencies\\\\native\\\\powershell\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8 C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.codex\\\\memories\\\\MEMORY.md | Select-String -Pattern 'storyOS|Story OS|停电夜|frame-semantic' -Context 2,2 | Select-Object -First 40\"","aggregated_output":"\r\n> # Task Group: Windows Claude Code third-party providers, CLI, and JetBrains CC GUI\r\nscope: Install, recover, upgrade, and diagnose the user's global Claude Code setup with file-based third-party provider\r\n configuration across `claude.cmd` and the JetBrains CC GUI plugin.\r\napplies_to: cwd=C:\\Users\\79873\\Documents; reuse_rule=paths, installed versions, provider models, and plugin internals a\r\nre machine/time-specific; reuse the settings.json-first recovery and two-runtime verification sequence, never store cre\r\ndentials.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Configure and maintain DeepSeek/Zhipu provider settings for CLI and CC GUI\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-06-15T02-08-44-LnNI-windows_claude_code_third_party_provider_setup_cli_and_gui.md (cwd=\\\\?\\C:\\\r\nUsers\\79873\\Documents, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\06\\15\\rollout-2026-06-15T10-08-44-019ec909-\r\nd312-70c3-a55d-7fe2b1b3957e.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-01T03:26:20+00:00, thread_id=019ec909-d312-70c3-a55d-7fe2b1b3957e\r\n, success: CLI and JetBrains GUI both verified against shared file-based settings)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- claude.cmd, npm.cmd, ~/.claude/settings.json, ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL, deepseek-v4-flash, open.bigmodel.cn/api/anthropic, \r\nidea-claude-code-gui, .codemoss/config.json, __local_settings_json__, CLAUDE_USE_STDIN, channel-manager.js, ConvertFrom\r\n-Json, UTF-8 BOM\r\n\r\n## User preferences\r\n\r\n- when setting up docs/scripts, the user asked twice: \"所有的文档都要是中文的\" -> make user-facing