me>/SKILL.md`; verify via a `/skill-name` CLI prompt. Third-party C\r\nhatCut installed only a Claude skill, not a Codex integration; after uninstall it may leave its skill folder behind. [T\r\nask 1]\r\n\r\n## Failures and how to do differently\r\n\r\n- Symptom: a `.ps1` shim says scripts are disabled, or a Chinese script parses incorrectly. Cause: machine execution po\r\nlicy / UTF-8-without-BOM. Fix: invoke `.cmd`; save Chinese `.ps1` as UTF-8 with BOM. [Task 1]\r\n- Symptom: `SetEnvironmentVariable(...,'User')` hangs. Cause: this machine stalls during environment broadcast. Fix: do\r\n not persist provider config in Windows env; prefer `settings.json` (registry writes are only a fallback for unrelated \r\nvariables). [Task 1]\r\n- Symptom: bridge receives empty/null message. Cause: `CLAUDE_USE_STDIN=true` was omitted. Fix: set it before piping JS\r\nON; do not infer GUI behavior from CLI success. [Task 1]\r\n- Symptom: a custom model generates an unknown-context-window warning. Fix: record it as a model-mapping limitation; us\r\ne the documented model override/window setting only after preserving valid provider configuration. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n# Task Group: youpu sprint / Pay allocation with Alipay/WeChat Mock channels\r\nscope: Implement, test, commit, or report the Pay module's Alipay Direct/ISV and WeChat allocation (profit-sharing) flo\r\nw; distinguish validated Mock coverage from unrun real-channel integration.\r\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform; reuse_rule=branch commits, retained work\r\ntree changes, external-channel readiness, and config values must be rechecked in the current sprint checkout; the JUnit\r\n4/Mock testing and precise-staging procedure is reusable.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Implement and validate allocation foundation, Mock channels, and state convergence\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-09-01T13-33-42-I4bX-yopu_pay_alloc_alipay_wechat_profit_share_mock_dev_and_comm