documents/state from t\r\nhe local commit, but it cannot restore ignored local media; treat any cleanup/move of that worktree as media-loss risk.\r\n [Task 3]\r\n\r\n# Task Group: aigc-dali-cat / Story OS V2.1 image_continue, Visual Lock, and production-progress reporting\r\nscope: Take over a preproduction-locked episode through `image_continue`, bind Visual Lock candidates with auditable us\r\ner exceptions, and report honest production progress; do not silently cross handoff or visual-evidence gates.\r\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat; reuse_rule=Story OS V2.1 scripts and the specific ep\r\nisode state are checkout-sensitive; reuse the authority order, state-machine rules, and Windows/Codex failure shields a\r\nfter rechecking current repository contracts.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Verify and activate preproduction handoff for 《停电夜蜕壳》\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-31T10-37-05-MHK5-aigc_dali_cat_11_01_tingdian_yetuke_visual_lock_image_contin.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D\r\n:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\31\\rollout-20\r\n26-08-31T18-37-05-01a05764-e6d4-7ce2-b8ce-828be30aa765.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-31T14:39:55+00:00, thread_id=01a05764-\r\ne6d4-7ce2-b8ce-828be30aa765, partial: handoff and four-frame binding completed; Visual Lock remains blocked by evidence\r\n/runtime gates)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- preproduction_handoff.py, preproduction-handoff.json, image_continue, HANDOFF_SHA_MISMATCH, stable_preproduction_subs\r\net, runtime-request.json, STORYBOARD_LOCKED\r\n\r\n## Task 2: Direct user-exception acceptance and four-frame Visual Lock binding\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-31T10-37-05-MHK5-aigc_dali_cat_11_01_tingdian_yetuke_visual_lock_image_contin.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D\r\n:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions