_review, codex_subscript\r\nion_image.py, episode-state.json, runtime-contract.json, M00\r\n\r\n## User preferences\r\n\r\n- when asking how to make a story run automatically, the user asked: \"后面我想给一个框架希望可以让story全自动执行，应该\r\n如何发送提示词呢\" -> provide the recognized authorization wording and an exact episode directory so execution can conti\r\nnue without per-step confirmation. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- Full-auto entrypoint is `python episodes/_system/story_os.py run <episode_dir> --full-auto`. The prompt should begin \r\n`对 episodes/XX_栏目/YY_剧集 全自动执行，一次做完，做到最终交付，不要每步问我。`; read `START_HERE.md`/`SKILL.md`, conf\r\nirm `meta/episode-state.json`, and record automated approvals as `delegated_auto_review`, never `direct_user_review`. [\r\nTask 1]\r\n- Full-auto is not complete merely because a worker exits: deterministic postflight must end `COMPLETE|PAUSED|BLOCKED`;\r\n completed delivery needs a final ZIP with real publish assets plus full text/manifest/hash. When no visual style is sp\r\necified, this repo defaults to `M00｜MP4 × 网吧 × 流水席旧数码质感校准版`; explicit device/era takes priority. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n## Failures and how to do differently\r\n\r\n\r\n# Task Group: youpu sprint / Guard AMap QPS, route enablement, and dev integration diagnosis\r\nscope: Configure and validate the Guard route/location AMap path across code defaults, deployment configuration, H5, ga\r\nteway, and dev runtime; use for silent `available=false`, QPS, or three-environment consistency investigations.\r\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform; reuse_rule=environment endpoints, runtim\r\ne Nacos values, tokens, users, and deployed commits are time-sensitive; the diagnostic sequence and configuration bound\r\naries are reusable.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Raise shared AMap QPS, enable Guard routes, and verify dev end to end\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-26T05-58-57-Ic4a-amap_guard_qps_route_enable_dev_testsync.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWo\r\nrkSpace\\youpu\\sprint\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\26\\rollout-2026-08-26T15-\r\n09-37-01a03ca6-753a-71b3-aba5-74a38e6d39e2_01a03ce7-2918-79d2-a319-8cdde74080e2.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-26T08:47:49+0\r\n0:00, thread_id=01a03ca6-753a-71b3-aba5-74a38e6d39e2, success: code/config changes, H5 validation, deployed-dev route a\r\nnd location verification)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- amap-global-qps, AmapConfig, GuardProperties, TRADE_GUARD_ROUTE_ENABLED, GuardRouteServiceImpl, available=false, amap\r\n:metrics:daily:*, driving:attempt, driving:success, geocode.api-key, /v1/trade/order/guard/route, 51006, H5/guardian, V\r\nITE_AMAP_JS_API_KEY, Nacos\r\n\r\n## User preferences\r\n\r\n- when sizing a configuration, the user said “我正式的生产环境可是有至少1w用户” -> assess capacity against the stated p\r\nroduction scale, not a low default. [Task 1]\r\n- when directing “改成200，构建H5，本地启动H5，后端链接走的应该是233或者232的dev环境” -> complete the config edit, buil\r\nds, startup, and actual gateway reachability check as one flow. [Task 1]\r\n- when the user said “在test、dev、prod三个环境都打开，配置要同步” and later asked whether the three environments are s\r\nynchronized -> check the code/config chain and report evidence, not memory; distinguish common defaults from Nacos runt\r\nime overrides. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- Trade and Account share the Redis second-window prefix `amap:rlimit:qps:`; 50 was a shared cap, so four defaults were\r\n set to 200. The direct per-location regeo call is `LocationSyncServiceImpl.updateUserLocation`; its QPS rejection sile\r\nntly returns an empty city DTO while location updating continues. [Task 1]\r\n- Set `trade.guard.route.enabled` and `GuardProperties.Route.enabled` true, then confirm environment-specific YAML has \r\nno overriding `trade.guard` section. The gateway whitelist exposes only the exact route path. Classpath configuration r\r\nequires repackaging/deployment