-> diagnose the visual carry of the first three images and the co\r\nmment hook from actual traffic lessons before rewriting the story. When the user says “ok，我已顶板”, treat the cover a\r\ns locked and provide final publishing materials rather than continuing variants. [Task 3]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- The report authority is `reports/数据验收报告.md`; `standards/数据验收报告.md` no longer exists. For Creator Center, \r\nconnect the bundled Chrome client to `agent.browsers.get(\"chrome\")`, locate the open tab titled “抖音创作者中心”, `chro\r\nme.user.claimTab(tab)`, then read `tab.playwright.domSnapshot()`. This retrieves plays, likes, comments, favorites, sha\r\nres, follows, average browse images, swipe-away rate, and copy expansion from the user's login session; independent pla\r\nywright-cli opens an unauthenticated browser. [Task 1]\r\n- The earlier pending status was superseded: live checks found 墨脱 published 2026-08-18 17:20 and 《系红线的梨》 publi\r\nshed 2026-08-19 17:50. At 2026-08-20 10:46 the current sample was 13 published posts/117 total works: 5,748 plays, mean\r\n 442.2, median 192, 泥人 35.5%, and outlier-removed mean 309.0. Recollect these time-sensitive facts on the next analys\r\nis. [Task 1]\r\n- Analyze this small, concentrated account using median and outlier-removed mean: 11 posts totalled about 5,570 plays (\r\naverage 506, median 232), while 泥人 supplied 36.6%; its removal gives about 353 mean plays. 泥人+保护站 supplied 59.0%\r\n and the top three 69.8%, so there is not yet a stable overall traffic level. [Task 2]\r\n- The validated content direction is “真实地点 + 科考/监测任务 + 关系人物 + 第3张前可见异常 + 20张内推进”; 20 images al\r\none are not success—《会认人的蟋蟀》 had 66 plays, average browse 4.0, and 52.94% swipe-away. The main structural weakn\r\ness is almost no discussion (about 21 comments across 11 posts): leave two visually supportable explanations in tension\r\n instead of asking directly in subtitles. [Task 2]\r\n- The two 17:00-slot posts are a signal, not proof: 墨脱 had 68 plays/44.57% swipe-away/4.6 average browse (weak distri\r\nbution and retention), while 种梨 had 41 plays/31.82% swipe-away/9.1 average browse (small distribution but good retent\r\nion). Historical 17:24/16:58 posts performed better, so do not assert “17点必然低流量.” Test three comparable 20-image \r\nposts at 19:00-19:15, >=24h apart, sampling 6h/24h; make 19:00 default only if at least 2/3 meet >192 plays, <=35% swip\r\ne-away, >=9/20 average browse, and >=1 comment at 24h. [Task 1]\r\n- 《蟋蟀》 was a decisive counterexample: 66 plays, average browse 4.0, 52.94% swipe-away despite an 8.75 scored releas\r\ne package. Treat package readiness as separate from traffic; if swipe-away remains >45%, audit whether 图01/03 independ\r\nently show the anomaly. The sample’s 5.1 posts/week also exceeded the 2–3/week operating target, while 21 comments acro\r\nss 11 posts show a discussion deficit. [Task 3]\r\n- 《种梨》 was not yet published at the analysis time. Its user-locked third cover is `images/封面.png`, title `别惹老\r\n道士`, final pinned comment “我只想知道，他分给全街人的梨，到底是不是我的。”, and order cover → 图01–20; record 6h/24h/\r\n48h only after actual publication. [Task 3]\r\n\r\n## Failures and how to do differently\r\n\r\n- Do not use independent playwright-cli to read Creator Center when it opens a QR/login page; claim the user's existing\r\n Chrome tab. [Task 1]\r\n- Repeated long-list scrolls and `domSnapshot()` can cause `js execution timed out; kernel reset` / `Tab #{id} is not p\r\nart of browser session`. Search by work title, or label old figures as carried forward rather than presenting them as f\r\nreshly collected. [Task 1]\r\n- `apply_patch` against Markdown can miss because bold markers or wording differ from expectation; first reread the exa\r\nct target lines and split large report edits into small patches. [Task 1]\r\n- Do not infer a 19:00 effect from one or two posts or misread a referenced work set; use the controlled three-post com\r\nparison while retaining content/retention as a separate factor. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n# Task Group: aigc-dali-cat / 08古籍志怪 S2《种梨》production, subtitle continuity, and source-text comparison\r\nscope: Continue the S2《种梨》visual-first story through 20-image/subtitle completion, source-faithful scoring, and pub\r\nlish readiness.\r\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat; reuse_rule=episode files and exact scores are story-\r\nspecific; four-frame admission, continuity QA, and two-layer source comparison are reusable.\r\n\r\n## Task 1: Select, produce, and audit 《种梨》 against the original text\r\n\r\n### rollout_summary_files\r\n\r\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-17T09-10-17-952L-aigc_dali_cat_zhongli_subtitle_continuity_and_original_text.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\r\n\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\17\\rollout-202\r\n6-08-17T17-10-18-01a00efc-6795-70e0-927e-7ed5ed0c2f47.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-18T01:36:52+00:00, thread_id=01a00efc-6\r\n795-70e0-927e-7ed5ed0c2f47, success: 20-image subtitle package and source comparisons completed; platform publication r\r\nemains user-side)\r\n\r\n### keywords\r\n\r\n- 08_古籍志怪, S2_种梨, 红线记号, 四图准入, add_subtitles.py, 图20, 识典古籍, ctext, 掬梨㗖且盡, docs/10, docs/11, publ\r\nish/\r\n\r\n## User preferences\r\n\r\n- for ancient-text adaptations, “先看看原版故事讲的什么？与原版对比，打分” -> provide original-skeleton retention and a\r\ndaptation-effect scoring, then connect a completed review to the next-series recommendation. [Task 1]\r\n- when a transition is confusing (“图19夜屋数梨…图20突然切回街角墙角”), inspect person/place/time/physical-evidence con\r\ntinuity across adjacent images; if images are already acceptable, propose the smallest subtitle-only repair and state t\r\nhe tradeoff. [Task 1]\r\n- when asking “这两份原文有什么区别呢?” or “字幕图片和原文故事相比”, keep source editions distinct and add a final subt\r\nitle-image-to-original comparison, not only a storyboard-level score. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- Candidat