onized. [Task 2]\r\n\r\n## Reusable knowledge\r\n\r\n- For `episodes/05c_神尸地图_混合版/`, read Chinese Markdown with `Get-Content -Raw -Encoding UTF8`; PowerShell default\r\n decoding can produce mojibake. The authority sources are `standards/制作规范_正式版.md` and root `现实侵入式伪纪录片_\r\n通用提示词模板_V1.0.md`. [Task 1]\r\n- Align `assets/README.md` with the 21-shot V1.1 production sequence before work: 图03 → 图08 → 图11 → 图14 → 图16 → 图\r\n21. Only after those pass, make 图01/04/05/07/09/12/17/19, then fill the rest. [Task 1]\r\n- Use incrementing `参考图_V{n}.png` versions; do not land unqualified candidates. The 2034 anchor must be synchronized\r\n across storyboard injection, character/device READMEs, and lock documents. [Task 1]\r\n- A vertical slit / third-eye entity is vetoed if it has blood, eyeballs, glow, a screen, gems, portal, wound, or grime\r\n. Require a narrow transparent matte membrane slit, gray-white mineralized edge, and a visible specific destination ins\r\nide. Yang Jian's third-eye face must avoid glowing blue eyes, hairpin, ancient embroidered costume, symmetric hero comp\r\nosition, and gold-repair patching. [Task 1]\r\n- Repair V2 bitmap-master proportions first, validate a small batch, then keyframes/video. Storyboard precedes Keyframe\r\n; EP001 is Giant Nut; paper-bag-inflates is historical/not scheduled. Inspect Git status/authority docs, then run rg, l\r\nink, and diff checks. [Task 2]\r\n- Build Week Devpost takes the repo URL; private repos need the two reviewer emails, and $100 Codex credits are request\r\ned separately. [Task 3]\r\n\r\n## Failures and how to do differently\r\n\r\n- `http 502 Bad Gateway: image edits/generations relay failed: The socket connection was closed unexpectedly` is treate\r\nd as a likely transient imagegen failure: wait 30–40 seconds and retry; if reference-image edits keep failing, try full\r\ny described fresh generation; if that also fails or candidates are noncompliant, do not land them—record \"待重出\" and t\r\nhe acceptance criteria in the lock document. [Task 1]\r\n- 杨戬三眼脸 V1 scored 3.5 because it combined prohibited glowing blue eyes, hairpin, ancient embroidery, symmetric her\r\no composition, and gold-repair patching; write the prohibitions into the prompt and visually inspect output before savi\r\nng. [Task 1]\r\n\r\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
