aw target, and only then `visual-finalize`. `latest.json` is navigation, not a gate; old V2.2.5 plans neither satis\\r\\nfy nor block append-only V2.2.7. [Task 1]\\r\\n- If gpt-image-2 returns a 3:2 landscape despite a 4:5 request and `canvas_normalize` says `source aspect too far from \\r\\ntarget for safe normalization`, deterministically center-crop the same image to target ratio and finalize it; do not ma\\r\\nke a second generation call. [Task 1]\\r\\n- For an upstream `http 502 Bad Gateway` / `upstream_server_error` under “只生成 1 张”, do not retry or switch model/CL\\r\\nI. Record `GENERATION_FAILED`, `real_image_created=false`, and the actual generation seconds with `visual-record-failur\\r\\ne`; if generation was mistakenly invoked before a run existed, immediately create/bind the run and explicitly record th\\r\\nat sequence. [Task 1]\\r\\n- Photography OS evidence lives at `episodes/10_彼此的天上/01_不存在的夜行路/meta/tests/photography-os/PT_.../`; runs c\\r\\narry contracts, frame prompts, generation/normalize/report JSON, and `regression-report.md`, while media is gitignored.\\r\\n The capture grammar is `FIRST_PERSON_CASUAL_SNAPSHOT_V1`; P01 is the fixed boyfriend/narrator for this episode and tar\\r\\nget is 1080×1350. [Task 2]\\r\\n- Round 2 recommendation was `CONDITIONAL_YES` for 01-20: first manually check frame 10 cart-push readability and recor\\r\\nd the frame 08 girlfriend-phone second-source attribution in the Storyboard. [Task 2]\\r\\n- V2.2.8 R2 adds primary-photographer/no-Ghost-Camera rules, Moment+Save Reason, natural time progression, physically c\\r\\noherent screen/UI content, and an 11-question review. The recorded verification was `python -m py_compile ...` plus `py\\r\\nthon episodes/_system/test_capture_grammar_v228.py`, yielding `CAPTURE GRAMMAR V2.2.8 SELF-TEST PASS` and `STORY OS V2.\\r\\n2.8 R2 LOCAL-SAFE INTEGRATION SELF-TEST PASS`; `a38f623` was pushed to `story`. [Task 3]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Failures and how to do differently\\r\\n\\r\\n- Symp