sions\\\\2026\\\\08\\\\26\\\\rollout-2026-08-26T15-\\r\\n09-37-01a03ca6-753a-71b3-aba5-74a38e6d39e2_01a03ce7-2918-79d2-a319-8cdde74080e2.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-26T08:47:49+0\\r\\n0:00, thread_id=01a03ca6-753a-71b3-aba5-74a38e6d39e2, success: code/config changes, H5 validation, deployed-dev route a\\r\\nnd location verification)\\r\\n\\r\\n### keywords\\r\\n\\r\\n- amap-global-qps, AmapConfig, GuardProperties, TRADE_GUARD_ROUTE_ENABLED, GuardRouteServiceImpl, available=false, amap\\r\\n:metrics:daily:*, driving:attempt, driving:success, geocode.api-key, /v1/trade/order/guard/route, 51006, H5/guardian, V\\r\\nITE_AMAP_JS_API_KEY, Nacos\\r\\n\\r\\n## User preferences\\r\\n\\r\\n- when sizing a configuration, the user said “我正式的生产环境可是有至少1w用户” -> assess capacity against the stated p\\r\\nroduction scale, not a low default. [Task 1]\\r\\n- when directing “改成200，构建H5，本地启动H5，后端链接走的应该是233或者232的dev环境” -> complete the config edit, buil\\r\\nds, startup, and actual gateway reachability check as one flow. [Task 1]\\r\\n- when the user said “在test、dev、prod三个环境都打开，配置要同步” and later asked whether the three environments are s\\r\\nynchronized -> check the code/config chain and report evidence, not memory; distinguish common defaults from Nacos runt\\r\\nime overrides. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Reusable knowledge\\r\\n\\r\\n- Trade and Account share the Redis second-window prefix `amap:rlimit:qps:`; 50 was a shared cap, so four defaults were\\r\\n set to 200. The direct per-location regeo call is `LocationSyncServiceImpl.updateUserLocation`; its QPS rejection sile\\r\\nntly returns an empty city DTO while location updating continues. [Task 1]\\r\\n- Set `trade.guard.route.enabled` and `GuardProperties.Route.enabled` true, then confirm environment-specific YAML has \\r\\nno overriding `trade.guard` section. The gateway whitelist exposes only the exact route path. Classpath configuration r\\r\\nequires repackaging/deployment; Nacos can still override defaults per namespace. [Task 1]\\r\\n- `available=false` is a deliberate silent-degradation result for route disabled, empty map key, missing location/desti\\r\\nnation, invalid coordinates, global QPS limit, or AMap failure; only IP/token rate limits throw 51006. First inspect `a\\r\\nmap:metrics:daily:*` `driving:attempt/success` to distinguish “not calling AMap” from an upstream failure. [Task 1]\\r\\n- In the verified dev run, the route switch was enabled but a blank geocode API key returned null; setting the key and \\r\\nrefreshing configuration produced `available=true` with distance/duration/points and increased `driving:success`. Never\\r\\n store API keys, database credentials, HMAC secrets, real tokens, phone numbers, order numbers, or user data in durable\\r\\n memory. [Task 1]\\r\\n- H5 uses Vite `/v1` proxy; confirm the reachable dev gateway rather than assuming an IP. A local ignored `.env` can pr\\r\\novide `VITE_AMAP_JS_API_KEY`; JS map keys are necessarily client-visible, so protect them with the provider’s JS-domain\\r\\n whitelist and keep `securityJsCode` behind a configured service-host proxy. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Failures and how to do differently\\r\\n\\r\\n- Do not infer dev gateway health from one IP: test the candidate endpoints. In this run one timed out while the other \\r\\nreturned the normal gateway result. [Task 1]\\r\\n- Do not conclude route is broken from repeated `available=false` alone. Check route enablement and `driving:attempt/su\\r\\nccess`; absence of rate-limit keys/counts indicated the path was not calling AMap, and a blank key was the decisive cau\\r\\nse. [Task 1]\\r\\n- Code defaults synchronized test/dev/prod do not prove runtime parity when Nacos is configured. If remote namespaces a\\r\\nre unreachable, state that verification gap and ask operators to inspect/deploy them. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n# Task Group: youpu sprint / IM group chat @ WebSocket acceptance, DDL governance, and Snapshot V2 diagnosis\\r\\nscope: Validate the deployed server-side group-chat @ flow with real sms-login accounts, verify its migration/rollback \\r\\nscripts, and diagnose dev runtime failures without conflating them with feature behavior.\\r\\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\youpu\\\\sprint\\\\yopu-cloud-platform; reuse_rule=only reuse the protocol and d\\r\\niagnosis sequence in this sprint checkout; recheck dev deployment, Nacos, Redis, database, and test data.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Task 1: Dual-account sms-login WebSocket @ acceptance, 27/27 pass\\r\\n\\r\\n### rollout_summary_files\\r\\n\\r\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-27T10-04-09-rtMH-yopu_im_group_mention_all_rate_limit_nacos_permission_fix_ac.md (cwd=\\\\\\\\?\\\\D\\r\\n:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\youpu\\\\sprint\\\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.codex\\\\sessions\\\\2026\\\\09\\\\01\\\\ro\\r\\nllout-2026-09-01T13-46-55-01a042ad-4e8f-73f0-92ff-21320d99f857_01a05b81-9b7b-7111-8259-403429bc8412.jsonl, updated_at=2\\r\\n026-09-01T06:24:16+00:00, thread_id=01a042ad-4e8f-73f0-92ff-21320d99f857, success: 27/27 dual-account dev acceptance pl\\r\\nus @all permission/rate-limit implementation)\\r\\n\\r\\n### keywords\\r\\n\\r\\n- sms-login, SmsCodeLoginRequest, mention_ws_acceptance.py, mention_ws_frames_20260831.log, cmd=1, cmd=2, cmd=11, cmd=1\\r\\n2, cmd=8, cmd=9, cmd=10, IMHandler, ImCommandConstant\\r\\n\\r\\n## Task 2: DDL rollback and explicit USE database verification\\r\\n\\r\\n### rollout_summary_files\\r\\n\\r\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-27T10-04-09-rtMH-yopu_im_group_mention_all_rate_limit_nacos_permission_fix_ac.md (cwd=\\\\\\\\?\\\\D\\r\\n:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\youpu\\\\sprint\\\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.codex\\\\sessions\\\\2026\\\\09\\\\01\\\\ro\\r\\nllout-2026-09-01T13-46-55-01a042ad-4e8f-73f0-92ff-21320d99f857_01a05b81-9b7b-7111-8259-403429bc8412.jsonl, updated_at=2\\r\\n026-09-01T06:24:16+00:00, thread_id=01a042ad-4e8f-73f0-92ff-21320d99f857, success: implementation compiled, merged, and\\r\\n deployment regression repaired)\\r\\n\\r\\n### keywords\\r\\n\\r\\n- V2026.08.28__group_mention_at.sql, V2026.08.28__group_mention_at_rollback.sql, USE DB_YOPU_IM, INFORMATION_SCHEMA, DR\\r\\nOP IF EXISTS, TB_MESSAGE_MENTION, TB_GROUP_MENTION_IDEMPOTENCY, LAST_MENTION_MSG_ID, MENTIONS_JSON\\r\\n\\r\\n## Task 3: Re-test dev @ flow, 21/27 exposes 2006010 Snapshot V2 version split\\r\\n\\r\\n### rollout_summary_files\\r\\n\\r\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-27T10-04-09-rtMH-yopu_im_group_mention_all_rate_limit_nacos_permission_fix_ac.md (cwd=\\\\\\\\?\\\\D\\r\\n:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\youpu\\\\sprint\\\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.codex\\\\sessions\\\\2026\\\\09\\\\01\\\\ro\\r\\nllout-2026-09-01T13-46-55-01a042ad-4e8f-73f0-92ff-21320d99f857_01a05b81-9b7b-7111-8259-403429bc8412.jsonl, updated_at=2\\r\\n026-09-01T06:24:16+00:00, thread_id=01a042ad-4e8f-73f0-92ff-21320d99f857, success: final 27/27 plus default 50/minute @\\r\\nall rate-limit verification)\\r\\n\\r\\n### keywords\\r\\n\\r\\n- 2006010, AUTH_SNAPSHOT_UNAVAILABLE, RelationAuthorizationSnapshotReader, buildV2GroupChatDecision, V2_ONLY, im.snapsh\\r\\not.auth.business-mode, policyVersion, memberVersion, FAIL_CLOSED, TB_IM_SNAPSHOT_DOMAIN_VERSION, GroupUserStatusFanoutS\\r\\nervice\\r\\n\\r\\n## User preferences\\r\\n\\r\\n- when requesting dev @ acceptance with “用…两个号…走sms-login…测试” -> exercise real accounts through the production-e\\r\\nquivalent login path and persist the runtime result in the formal acceptance document. [Task 1]\\r\\n- when asking “ddl有回滚脚本吗？sql脚本有use database吗” -> treat paired rollback and an explicit `USE <database>;` hea\\r\\nder as default DDL delivery checks; state their safety boundary. [Task 2]\\r\\n- when asking “测试下dev的@ 功能” -> reuse or reconstruct the acceptance script, then keep investigating a failure to d\\r\\nistinguish product behavior from environment-level data/runtime defects. [Task 3]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Reusable knowledge\\r\\n\\r\\n- WS contract verified here: cmd=1/2 login, 3/4 heartbeat, 11 group send, 12 ACK/push, 8 read, and 9/10 offline. The re\\r\\nal dual-client script covers login, heartbeat, ACK/@ echo, push, read, offline, authorization, idempotency, and symmetr\\r\\nic @all; results belong in `docs/architecture/群聊支持@功能-服务端实施测试验收方案-20260827.md`. [Task 1]\\r\\n- Normalize sms-login `data.userInfo.userId` with `int(...)`; on Windows make the script console-safe with `sys.stdout.\\r\\nreconfigure(encoding=\\\"utf-8\\\", errors=\\\"replace\\\")`. Allow time after ACK before closing a receiver for offline assertions\\r\\n because MQ delivery can still be in flight. [Task 1]\\r\\n- Both forward and rollback scripts start with `USE DB_YOPU_IM;`. The forward migration covers mention tables and the l\\r\\nisted session/offline/pending columns; rollback uses INFORMATION_SCHEMA guards and `DROP ... IF EXISTS`, deletes struct\\r\\nure rather than backing up data, and therefore requires the feature off plus a data backup before execution. [Task 2]\\r\\n- Current dev failure signature: group send cmd=12 returns `2006010` when V2_ONLY reads a group whose policy and member\\r\\n manifests have divergent versions. Check group policy/recipients/member manifests in Redis plus `DB_YOPU_CRM.TB_IM_SNA\\r\\nPSHOT_DOMAIN_VERSION`; this was reproduced on a non-test group, so it is not a test-account exception. [Task 3]\\r\\n- The current reader strictly requires `policy.version == member.version`, while domain-local writes can increment memb\\r\\ner/recipients without policy; mismatch is only metered, and reconcile repairs missing rather than version-divergent dom\\r\\nains. Do not hand-edit code/data during diagnosis; choose and review either a coherent group-level version model or syn\\r\\nchronized write-side versioning. [Task 3]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Failures and how to do differently\\r\\n\\r\\n- Symptom: sms-login test reports an ID mismatch or crashes writing emoji. Cause: userId is a