BLISH_READY` (the latter also lacks `publish-event.json`); record that discrepancy, then use V2.1 `post\\r\\n_publish_review.py mark-published` as a separate formal transition. Never hand-edit `current_state` or fabricate a publ\\r\\nish event. [Task 2]\\r\\n- Recount rows and sums (播放/评论/吸粉), run `git diff --check`, and grep superseded values after every report edit; t\\r\\nhis 08-31 refresh also used `rg -c '^\\\\\\\\| (\\\\\\\\*\\\\\\\\*)?([0-9]+)'` to confirm 22 work rows. [Task 2]\\r\\n- Use the four-layer reading: L1 entry (`划走率`) → L2 reading carry (`均浏览图`/average reading depth) → L3 interactio\\r\\nn (likes/comments/favorites/shares) → L4 follows; rates use the play denominator. `均浏览图 ÷ 总张数` is average readin\\r\\ng-depth share, not completion rate/末页到达率. [Task 2][Task 3]\\r\\n- Before editing a high-churn report, reread current exact lines with `rg`/`Get-Content`; after edits run `git diff --c\\r\\nheck -- 'reports/数据验收报告.md'` and grep superseded values throughout the report. [Task 1][Task 2]\\r\\n- Four-layer diagnostic: L1 entry (`划走率`) → L2 reading carry (`均浏览图`) → L3 interaction (likes/comments/favorites\\r\\n/shares) → L4 follows. At the 08-31 snapshot, 《瓶中世界》 was ~51h and “基本进入长尾” (strong L1/L2, weak L3/L4); 《鳌\\r\\n太线·热汤》 was ~23.5h (comments signal, 0 follows) and still needs a 48h read. Treat these as operating inference, not\\r\\n an official algorithm claim. [Task 1]\\r\\n- For the 17-work account sample, plays correlate with 均浏览图 (Spearman about +0.76) and 平均阅读深度占比 (about +0.6\\r\\n1), and inversely with 划走率 (about -0.76); this supports “先停留、再深读” for this account but is correlation, not pl\\r\\natform-weight causality. Official Douyin material supports user-content matching, multi-round ranking, and behavior-pro\\r\\nbability prediction, not fixed traffic-pool tiers or percentage weights. [Task 3]\\r\\n- Keep local pre-publication/production acceptance scores separate from post-publication recommendation performance. 《\\r\\n村子》 at the 2026-08-26 refresh was 474 plays, 均浏览 9.6, 划走率 27.85%, average depth 45.7%, and only “A档强势早期”;\\r\\n do not redo title/cover/front sequence solely on this point or let one 4:5 result override the 9:16 gate. [Task 3]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Failures and how to do differently\\r\\n\\r\\n- Symptom: `apply_patch verification failed: Failed to find expected lines`. Cause: the report has frequently changed a\\r\\nnd the patch used stale context. Fix: read current UTF-8 lines with `rg`/`Get-Content` before patching; if a page snaps\\r\\nhot is older than the report, retain the newer report snapshot rather than overwriting it. [Task 1]\\r\\n- A dynamic Creator Center/public-homepage timeout means missing evidence, not “no new post.” Account-level fans/likes \\r\\nmust be live-recollected or explicitly labelled as a prior verified snapshot; never present them as current. Never back\\r\\nfill a missed 6h/24h/48h/7d checkpoint from a later overview. [Task 1][Task 2]\\r\\n\\r\\n# Task Group: youpu-cloud-platform / first audio-video call after friend addition has no callee response\\r\\nscope: Diagnose intermittent first-call signal loss with static code/git evidence; route future investigations to runti\\r\\nme call/routing logs before implementing a fix.\\r\\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\youpu\\\\yopu-cloud-platform; reuse_rule=class lines, branch state, commits, \\r\\nand dev endpoints are checkout/time-specific; signal-chain tracing and evidence thresholds are reusable.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Task 1: Diagnose first voice/video call ignored, second or third call works\\r\\n\\r\\n### rollout_summary_files\\r\\n\\r\\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-22T07-59-31-LoVE-yopu_im_first_call_after_friend_add_no_response_analysis.md (cwd=\\\\\\\\?\\\\D:\\\\wo\\r\\nrkspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\youpu\\\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=\\\\\\\\?\\\\C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\.codex\\\\sessions\\\\2026\\\\08\\\\22\\\\rollout-2\\r\\n026-08-22T15-59-31-01a0287b-6739-7712-8186-ef0a884e9b7e.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-22T08:30:43+00:00, thread_id=01a0287b\\r\\n-6739-7712-8186-ef0a884e9b7e, uncertain: static chain verified; no runtime [CALL_DEBUG] evidence)\\r\\n\\r\\n### keywords\\r\\n\\r\\n- CallServiceImpl, initiateCall, sendCallSignal, CALL_INVITE, CALL_DEBUG, getUserRoutes, route:user:clients, SIGNAL_EXC\\r\\nHANGE, consumeSignal, 音视频信令投递失败，用户不在线, AUTH_SNAPSHOT_UNAVAILABLE, b001ea6ac\\r\\n\\r\\n## User preferences\\r\\n\\r\\n- for an IM symptom report, the user twice replied only “继续” during investigation -> continue the read-only chain (me\\r\\nmory → code → git history → executable evidence plan) rather than stopping early for speculation or unnecessary clarifi\\r\\ncation. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Reusable knowledge\\r\\n\\r\\n- Call chain is `IMHandler.handleCallInvite` → `IMServiceImpl.initiateCall` → `CallServiceImpl.initiateCall` → `sendCal\\r\\nlSignal(calleeId, CALL_INVITE)`. It is synchronous on the Netty worker and does not pass `authorizeSingleChat` / `Relat\\r\\nionAuthorizationSnapshotReader`; `AUTH_SNAPSHOT_UNAVAILABLE`, friend-snapshot fence, and welcome-message conclusions do\\r\\n not explain call delivery. [Task 1]\\r\\n- `sendCallSignal` chooses local `channelManager.sendToUser`, remote `MessageProducer.sendSignal` to `SIGNAL_EXCHANGE` \\r\\nwith `{serverId}.signal`, then direct fallback when `hasActiveChannel`. `MessageConsumer.consumeSignal` ACK-drops a rem\\r\\note signal if the callee has no active channel: “信令无重试队列/DLQ，直接丢弃并告警.” [Task 1]\\r\\n- Route model is per-client `yopu:im:route:user:{userId}:{clientType}` plus client set `yopu:im:route:user:clients:{use\\r\\nrId}` and legacy single key; online means `onlineStatus==1`, TTL 180s. On this checkout `CALL_DEBUG=true`; inspect `rou\\r\\nteCount`, decision/fallback lines, the offline warning, and client CALL_INVITE/UI evidence before ranking root causes. \\r\\n`routeCount=0` while online points first to a missing clients-set write. [Task 1]\\r\\n- Historical route leads: `b001ea6ac` covers non-atomic RBatch route writes/client-set loss; `86de7f055` covers RBatch \\r\\nread contention via getAsync+30s cache. The candidate retry/refresh/client UI remedies remain proposals until runtime e\\r\\nvidence selects one. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Failures and how to do differently\\r\\n\\r\\n- Do not analogize call behavior from single-chat authorization snapshots before tracing the actual call path; the init\\r\\nial AUTH_SNAPSHOT hypothesis was disproved. [Task 1]\\r\\n- In PowerShell, `find` can return `Parameter format not correct` and formatted `Select-Object FullName` can truncate p\\r\\naths. Use `Get-ChildItem -Recurse -Filter 'Name.java' | ForEach-Object { $_.FullName }` or an exact full path. Probe de\\r\\nv endpoints with bounded parallel short timeouts after confirming connectivity. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n# Task Group: dashi-taskboard (Codex Taskboard) evaluation, local install, and Windows integration\\r\\nscope: Evaluate, install, and diagnose the local Codex Taskboard; distinguish its own task database from existing Codex\\r\\n tasks and keep the Windows service loopback-only.\\r\\napplies_to: cwd=C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\Documents; reuse_rule=repository stars, release activity, package versions, defaults, an\\r\\nd CI state are time-sensitive; the evaluation workflow and local-network security checks are reusable.\\r\\n\\r\\n## Task 1: Evaluate and locally install chuspeeism/dashi-taskboard\\r\\n\\r\\n### rollout_summary_files\\r\\n\\r\\n\\r\\n### keywords\\r\\n\\r\\n- dashi-taskboard, chuspeeism/dashi-taskboard, Codex Taskboard, React 19, Node 22, SQLite, Tauri, taskctl, npm ci, npm \\r\\nrun check, /health, CODEX_TASKBOARD_HOST, 0.0.0.0:47823, 127.0.0.1, CDP, CSP, Windows unsigned\\r\\n\\r\\n## User preferences\\r\\n\\r\\n- when the user writes “dashi-taskboard 看看这个github仓库” without criteria -> respond in Chinese and proactively use \\r\\na structured repository assessment (identify → README/metadata/direct files → maturity/activity/risk → actionable trial\\r\\n recommendation), not a one-paragraph summary. [Task 1]\\r\\n- when the user says “看不到我codex正在执行的任务啊” -> explain that the browser version tracks only tasks created in i\\r\\nts own database; it does not import existing Codex tasks, and tracking starts from Taskboard. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Reusable knowledge\\r\\n\\r\\n- Prefer the direct GitHub repository page and raw `README`/`package.json`/`AGENTS.md`/`LICENSE`/`PRIVACY.md` plus CI a\\r\\nnd commits over stale search snippets; search-result star counts diverged during this review. [Task 1]\\r\\n- The captured project was a local-first React 19 + Node 22 + SQLite + Tauri taskboard with `taskctl` and an internal C\\r\\nodex Skill using the same HTTP API. Default host `0.0.0.0:47823` has no LAN account authentication; for a local trial e\\r\\nxplicitly set `$env:CODEX_TASKBOARD_HOST = '127.0.0.1'`. Install at `D:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\yeqian\\\\dashi-taskboar\\r\\nd` with `npm ci` then `npm run check`; verified health endpoint is `/health`, not `/api/health`. [Task 1]\\r\\n- The independent browser service cannot scan/import arbitrary existing Codex chats. For tracked work use Taskboard cre\\r\\nate task → “open in conversation” → Codex processes it → `taskctl` records `CODEX_THREAD_ID`. [Task 1]\\r\\n- On Windows/MS Store Codex, the source Launcher failed `Unable to inspect the launched Codex process`; prefer the offi\\r\\ncial NSIS installer if the user explicitly confirms its unsigned installer. Verify a resumed download's SHA-256 before \\r\\nopening it. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Failures and how to do differently\\r\\n\\r\\n- Symptom: search results disagree on repository statistics. Fix: cite/decide from the current direct repository page a\\r\\nnd raw files, not cached search cards. [Task 1]\\r\\n\\r\\n# Task Group: Windows Codex C-drive space cleanup, generated-image junction, and session-growth diagnosis\\r\\nscope: Free C-drive capacity safely when Codex data or caches grow; use for