pdate request means collect backend nu\\r\\nmbers rather than leaving a placeholder. [Task 1]\\r\\n- when the user said “我看了剧情，没看懂” and “第二层的土层样不够明显” -> user readability is a pre-publication hard ga\\r\\nte; internal 9.20/10 or image acceptance cannot substitute for a comprehensible story/world. [Task 2]\\r\\n- when asking whether old irrelevant or low-traffic videos should be hidden, the user needs a concrete per-work “立即隐\\r\\n藏 / 暂时保留 / 条件隐藏” classification, not a blanket view-count rule. [Task 3]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Reusable knowledge\\r\\n\\r\\n- On the Creator Center content page, DOM/screenshot/visible-tree/CDP reads can hang in dynamic loading. Refresh the ex\\r\\nisting tab, then use `playwright.domSnapshot()`; after reload it exposed the complete metrics. Record views, likes, com\\r\\nments, favorites, shares, follows, average browse images, swipe-away rate, and copy-expansion rate without interchange.\\r\\n [Task 1]\\r\\n- The current authoritative report is `reports/数据验收报告.md`; `standards/数据验收报告.md` disappeared after commit `\\r\\n7cb2e8e59de7c336da9868c2dd744e52d5e8eabf`. Distinguish content-management totals from 6h/24h/48h/7d cards, and run `git\\r\\n diff --check` after editing. At the captured point, fans were 44 and `2224 / 44 = 50.5:1`. [Task 1]\\r\\n- K5’s internal review was 9.20/10, but the user’s earlier review found its second underground world unreadable. That f\\r\\needback remains the regeneration criterion: if revisiting it, re-render only 01/03/04 to show a continuous underground \\r\\nground plane extending into depth, not a small soil slab, step, or suspended platform; leave the other 17 images untouc\\r\\nhed. Later project evidence records K5 as published at 2026-08-14 22:23 with backend title「裂缝」; use `reports/数据验\\r\\n收报告.md` or platform evidence for current status rather than the earlier hold conclusion. [Task 2]\\r\\n- For account strategy, use one release-ready parallel experiment rather than betting on a route: 05d (8.7/10) and S1 \\r\\n墨脱 (subtitle review 20/20) were candidates. Judge it at 24h/48h by comments above zero and views at least S4's 454 or\\r\\n approaching 泥人's 1507. The account's reusable pattern was 20 images + strong first three + strong relationship. [Tas\\r\\nk 3]\\r\\n- Preserve low-view but on-theme work; set clearly off-topic content such as PVZ to private rather than deleting it. Pr\\r\\nivacy is not proven to restore recommendations. Record name/views/likes/comments/favorites/shares/follows before changi\\r\\nng visibility. [Task 3]\\r\\n\\r\\n## Failures and how to do differently\\r\\n\\r\\n- “Page read failed” was once written as “no new post” -> retract that conclusion, refresh the tab, and report the evid\\r\\nence gap until metrics are actually read. [Task 1]\\r\\n- Earlier evidence recommended K5 first only subject to final review; the user then found the core world unreadable -> \\r\\nexplicit readability feedback wins over internal scoring. The prior “do not upload” decision is superseded by later evi\\r\\ndence of a 2026-08-14 22:23 publication; do not infer either unpublished or published status from `k5_publish` alone. [\\r\\nTask 2]\\r\\n- `read_thread` with `includeOutputs:true` can exceed the IPC frame limit (`code-mode IPC frame length 67375107 exceeds\\r\\n 67108864 bytes`) -> use `includeOutputs:false`, a small `turnLimit`, and cursor paging for status/conclusion retrieval\\r\\n. [Task 2]\\r\\n\\r\\n# Task Group: aigc-dali-cat / 05d publish completion, release timing, and first-person copy\\r\\nscope: Prepare the 05d 神尸地图·嫦娥 image post for a safe release: reconcile actual publish assets, choose a measured \\r\\naccount-specific time window, and finalize audience-facing title/copy/metadata.\\r\\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\\\workspace\\\\YeQianWorkSpace\\\\yeqian\\\\aigc-dali-cat; reuse_rule=use the asset-selection and copy structur\\r\\ne for similar image posts, but re-read the current `reports\\\\数据验收报告.md`, production standard, episode acceptance f\\r\\niles,