不是掉墙皮。\\\"\\n  17: \\\"我跑过去的时候，它把整座城顶了起来。\\\\n松握的手机被卷走，攥紧包带的手只被划了一道。\\\"\\n  18: \\\"零点过几分，电来了。我到了家，手机却没了。\\\"\\n  19: \\\"药房外墙缺了一块——和我抽屉里那块一模一样。\\\"\\n  20: \\\"第二天我才发现，县城变旧，也许不是年头到了。\\\"\\n\\r\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.451307Z  WARN codex_protocol::openai_models: Model personality requested but model_messages is missing, falling back to base instructions. model=deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash personality=pragmatic\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.534133Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring hooks: expected a string, string array, object, or object array; found object\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.535688Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring hooks: expected a string, string array, object, or object array; found object\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.536285Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring hooks: expected a string, string array, object, or object array; found object\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.537790Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring hooks: expected a string, string array, object, or object array; found object\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.539443Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring hooks: expected a string, string array, object, or object array; found object\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.543806Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring hooks: expected a string, string array, object, or object array; found object\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.786429Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_small: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.786465Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_large: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.813495Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_small: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.813534Z  WARN codex_core_skills::loader: ignoring interface.icon_large: icon path must not contain '..'\n2026-09-03T20:15:51.836076Z  WARN codex_core_plugins::manifest: ignoring hooks: expected a string, string array, object, or objec